  "body": "## What changed\n- Added `target: Option<&'a [Triangle]>` to `stock_sim::Mark` in `crates/sim/src/stock_sim/mark.rs`.\n- Updated `credit_marks` so a mark with `target: Some(parts)` checks `part_surface` and `undersides` on `parts` alone and skips columns whose top belongs to another part.\n- Added `SimMark`, `target_facets`, and `sim_mark_of` in `crates/app/src/operation/mark_law.rs`.\n- Wired `Planned::mark` and `stock_sim_marks::program_marks` to pass `None` for stock-source marks and `Some(facets)` for part-source marks.\n- Recorded the design choice in `docs/decisions/1627-mark-credit-target-parts.md`.\n\n## Cause\n`mark_law::budget_of` declared a mark budget without saying which part carried it. `stock_sim::credit_marks` credited every declared mark against all setup parts (`model_facets`), so a part-source mark on B whose flank entered a neighbour A passed the program sim.\n\n## Tests\n- Pins:\n  - `crates/app/tests/neighbour_law.rs::the_program_sim_refuses_a_mark_on_b_whose_flank_enters_a_neighbour` (red before fix: panicked at `trace false picked false: the program sim credited B's mark on A`; green after fix).\n  - `crates/sim/tests/mark_credit.rs::a_part_targeted_mark_never_credits_a_neighbouring_part` (green).\n  - `crates/sim/tests/mark_credit.rs::a_part_targeted_mark_uses_its_own_top_and_underside` (green).\n- Mutations:\n  - Setting `target: None` in `crates/app/src/stock_sim_marks.rs` turns `the_program_sim_refuses_a_mark_on_b_whose_flank_enters_a_neighbour` red; restoring turns it green.\n  - Ignoring `mark.target` (`let part = None;`) in `crates/sim/src/stock_sim/mark.rs` turns both new `mark_credit` pins red; restoring turns them green.\n- Gate: `cargo xtask gate quick --base HEAD` (2 steps: `sim suites` 35s, 43 `app suites` + lib 513s) and `cargo clippy -p camcraft-sim -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed after the final edit.\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\n- Multi-setup carried programs spanning different part alignments (`walked.spanned`) with part-source marks.\n- `cargo xtask gate batch` and `crates/ui` suites.\n\n## Overlaps\nNone.\n\nChangelog: Program simulation now credits part-source Engrave and Trace marks only on the marked part(s), never on neighbouring parts.\nEffort: high\nFixes #1627\n",
